<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from June 19 to June 25, 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 66.21</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 70.51</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 72.50</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 76.14</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$180.22</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$135.16</p>
<p>Unsweetened or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 96.15</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 25.83</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.58</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 28.48</p>
</text>
